{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_04",
  "title": "我曾捨命為你",
  "storyCode": "HE-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c00ae3d6f2257f9c0e9df11937e3f11ea94846da7c6109e1c218a4e723ee87c3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有一點驚訝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為我終究背叛了信仰嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是因為你的逃避，斯特凡諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不知道你是否是受到了什麼外物的影響，如果......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有如果，奧盧斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還不至於受源石技藝影響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有時轉變我們想法的並不一定是源石技藝。有太多東西足以影響我們，斯特凡諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你在勸我重新考慮。為什麼，異教的教士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如今我的決定，難道不是你想要看到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不能否認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我也得承認，在這座了不起的建築尚在伊比利亞時，我曾有幸在此學習，那段時光對於那時的我來說彌足珍貴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斯特凡諾，在這方面我同你一樣。我對這裡同樣懷有感情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還記得那位和你一起從拉特蘭來的修士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得許多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你記得的那個人，在六十年前帶上他的銃，決定和當時的國教會共進退，而我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我選擇留下，保護剩下的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你以此為信念，堅持至今。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然你清楚，你仍要我繼續等待，繼續忍耐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難道你現在要否認你一直宣揚的那些，轉而要我斟酌，勸我堅定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然不。斯特凡諾，當然不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是，正因我行走在我認為正確的路上，便希望你也如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明天早上，如果你仍然堅持，那麼我便認為這就是你的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會準備好你需要的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你還沒有想好，我會勸你繼續考慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不論如何......我希望你的決定發自真心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......奧盧斯，你弄錯了一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已別無選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧，如果真是如此......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼我會歡迎你，斯特凡諾，我新的同胞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "介意我進來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......請進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打擾了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看起來不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我可以問一個問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......菲娜她，是不是已經......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經不在了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......如果可以的話，我比較希望你能換一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不太想騙你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實我最開始就有這樣的感覺......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個時候，我忽然就、就感受不到菲娜......明明她那時那麼生氣，又那麼難過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她就在我面前啊......？我卻哪裡都找不到她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果當時，我沒幫你修那把銃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別說了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......別說了，求你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我頭頂的角，我摸到了。和萊蒙德他們一樣的角。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然再也沒法握著銃祈禱，但至少現在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我終於，和萊蒙德，和卡洛琳姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我終於和大家都一樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，去年還沒這麼早開花，今年怎麼就這麼巧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也好，好歹算是最後開了一回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣一來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣就沒問題了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你剛剛說......有薩科塔墮天？那個女孩叫福爾圖娜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "竟然出了這樣的事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "墮天......只能回去後由教宗閣下定奪，不是現在我們能夠處理的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但闖入我房間的那位不速之客不同。費德里科，有些事我之後再和你解釋......現在必須要儘快把那傢伙找出來才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我需要你的協助，執行者費德里科。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它的機動性不弱，我雖然勉強追到這裡，但還是追丟了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦，你居然沒有立刻回覆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很少見哦，你這樣子我會覺得是出了什麼大事......欸，你皺眉了，所以真的出了什麼大事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......有琴聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "琴聲？有......嗎？我好像沒有聽到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "據我推斷，琴聲是從頂層聖堂的方向傳來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老實說呢，這段時間以來我對你在公證所的工作多少有所瞭解，因此我會比較信任你的判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在我正式地詢問你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中庭公證所執行者費德里科，你真的認為這段來源不明，不確定影響，甚至有可能全然無害的琴聲——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "會比我向你提出的協助請求更加重要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "顯而易見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "琴聲的出現是偶然事件，我對此有所懷疑，但不可否認的是，暫時找不到其與目前發生的所有事件之間的直接關聯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "根據目前的形勢判斷，應優先執行協助任務，與你共同行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵呵，不繼續說下去了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啦，我可沒有要欺負人的意思。只不過，我也確實需要確認一下你的態度......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給我指一個方向，我繼續追蹤目標，琴聲的事就交給你來解決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......本次任務需要優先確保你和奧倫的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "盡職盡責是好事，但是我覺得優先度這種東西，是要自己判斷的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我感受不到你的情緒，費德里科。不過，我有一個黎博利朋友，因為無法和她共感，所以我早早學會了如何猜測他人的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然她比你好懂很多，但有些東西是共通的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一個小小的忠告——或許有的時候，你得學會相信你的直覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就這麼定了，我們沒有多少時間可以浪費......我也得強迫自己活動一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出發，大家行動起來~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "加快速度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "費德里科先生！請、請等一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上面到底......到底有什麼？只是琴聲而已，而且現在已經聽不到了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們、我們真的就讓那位小姐一個人去冒險嗎？她還坐著輪椅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼可能不擔心？我剛剛看到了......那是個怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蕾繆安由第七廳樞機親自邀請加入教皇廳，實力不容小覷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要小看她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不太明白這些，也就是說，那位小姐也是很厲害的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是......萬一呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "加快速度。或者留在原地等待。"
