      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "細微的聲響在空曠的聖堂內盪開，銃上膛的聲音與其同步響起。\n執行者猛然舉起銃。"
